{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/89fe933e48b520c9d4242c2f46ce4e52.avif?t=1773070451\" width=780 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/844577454c186d6723ab5483b15d3eab.poster.avif?t=1773070451\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/844577454c186d6723ab5483b15d3eab.webm?t=1773070451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/844577454c186d6723ab5483b15d3eab.mp4?t=1773070451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think before you move. Once you move, your vision gets limited, and only memory and reflexes can save you. How fast are your reactions in the dark?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/ba3c4dd87e2f3e8f2af4fde66f355add.avif?t=1773070451\" width=780 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/1e2b7283caa17fcf0ff5c0b06e8aa341.poster.avif?t=1773070451\" width=780 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/1e2b7283caa17fcf0ff5c0b06e8aa341.webm?t=1773070451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/1e2b7283caa17fcf0ff5c0b06e8aa341.mp4?t=1773070451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From pros to casuals, choose how you want to play with customizable difficulty options. Adjust vision range in the dark and explore other accessibility-friendly settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/61ec537884440bf0fff7b314f0d0ae22.avif?t=1773070451\" width=780 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/f74b11d0d652739f9e685cdc7ce4c590.poster.avif?t=1773070451\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/f74b11d0d652739f9e685cdc7ce4c590.webm?t=1773070451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/f74b11d0d652739f9e685cdc7ce4c590.mp4?t=1773070451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You only have a limited number of lights each level. Move and stop too often, and you\u2019ll run out of lights and be in total darkness for the rest of the stage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/08a4f1706ec53d9a7ca53828cb9113e3.avif?t=1773070451\" width=780 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/d0f947f4392fb099ddfadb7c13e7488c.poster.avif?t=1773070451\" width=780 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/d0f947f4392fb099ddfadb7c13e7488c.webm?t=1773070451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/d0f947f4392fb099ddfadb7c13e7488c.mp4?t=1773070451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each crystal and gem comes with its own unique challenge. Only the most skilled adventurers can uncover every lost treasure hidden in the darkness!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/8823963f84274b780a3dc61a87b19534.avif?t=1773070451\" width=780 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/1306bde32c7668de39097dc522d56dc9.poster.avif?t=1773070451\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/1306bde32c7668de39097dc522d56dc9.webm?t=1773070451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/1306bde32c7668de39097dc522d56dc9.mp4?t=1773070451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dr. Fog will do anything to keep the world in darkness. Only sharp reflexes, precise movement, and fearless determination will let you defeat his shadowy allies and ultimately face him!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/f71478483d838f9ec83d7ca99b4ff4c6.avif?t=1773070451\" width=780 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/d5b64009f25a8816afa78b24cff6584b.poster.avif?t=1773070451\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/d5b64009f25a8816afa78b24cff6584b.webm?t=1773070451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/d5b64009f25a8816afa78b24cff6584b.mp4?t=1773070451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to feel every step? Jump into First-Person Mode for total immersion!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the developer &amp; how this game came to life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi I\u2019m Ramy! Light Dude is my first ever video game on Steam! This whole game was born from suffering\u2026\u00a0I was walking back from the bathroom in the dark, confident I knew the layout of my own room... until my bed frame reminded me I didn\u2019t... My toe lost 99% of its HP, but at least I unlocked a new game idea!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/9a3d8ac078512a2bdc0d193b71eb92e5.poster.avif?t=1773070451\" width=780 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/9a3d8ac078512a2bdc0d193b71eb92e5.webm?t=1773070451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/9a3d8ac078512a2bdc0d193b71eb92e5.mp4?t=1773070451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3055110?t=1773070451","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/04051bbb0075fc416fad653e109be6247c67ec41/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773070451","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/02d678aba3a8259ddea5bb5058f01eaeec8f7162/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773070451","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/02d678aba3a8259ddea5bb5058f01eaeec8f7162/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773070451","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/89fe933e48b520c9d4242c2f46ce4e52.avif?t=1773070451\" width=780 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/844577454c186d6723ab5483b15d3eab.poster.avif?t=1773070451\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/844577454c186d6723ab5483b15d3eab.webm?t=1773070451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/844577454c186d6723ab5483b15d3eab.mp4?t=1773070451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think before you move. Once you move, your vision gets limited, and only memory and reflexes can save you. How fast are your reactions in the dark?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/ba3c4dd87e2f3e8f2af4fde66f355add.avif?t=1773070451\" width=780 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/1e2b7283caa17fcf0ff5c0b06e8aa341.poster.avif?t=1773070451\" width=780 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/1e2b7283caa17fcf0ff5c0b06e8aa341.webm?t=1773070451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/1e2b7283caa17fcf0ff5c0b06e8aa341.mp4?t=1773070451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From pros to casuals, choose how you want to play with customizable difficulty options. Adjust vision range in the dark and explore other accessibility-friendly settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/61ec537884440bf0fff7b314f0d0ae22.avif?t=1773070451\" width=780 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/f74b11d0d652739f9e685cdc7ce4c590.poster.avif?t=1773070451\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/f74b11d0d652739f9e685cdc7ce4c590.webm?t=1773070451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/f74b11d0d652739f9e685cdc7ce4c590.mp4?t=1773070451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You only have a limited number of lights each level. Move and stop too often, and you\u2019ll run out of lights and be in total darkness for the rest of the stage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/08a4f1706ec53d9a7ca53828cb9113e3.avif?t=1773070451\" width=780 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/d0f947f4392fb099ddfadb7c13e7488c.poster.avif?t=1773070451\" width=780 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/d0f947f4392fb099ddfadb7c13e7488c.webm?t=1773070451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/d0f947f4392fb099ddfadb7c13e7488c.mp4?t=1773070451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each crystal and gem comes with its own unique challenge. Only the most skilled adventurers can uncover every lost treasure hidden in the darkness!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/8823963f84274b780a3dc61a87b19534.avif?t=1773070451\" width=780 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/1306bde32c7668de39097dc522d56dc9.poster.avif?t=1773070451\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/1306bde32c7668de39097dc522d56dc9.webm?t=1773070451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/1306bde32c7668de39097dc522d56dc9.mp4?t=1773070451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dr. Fog will do anything to keep the world in darkness. Only sharp reflexes, precise movement, and fearless determination will let you defeat his shadowy allies and ultimately face him!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/f71478483d838f9ec83d7ca99b4ff4c6.avif?t=1773070451\" width=780 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/d5b64009f25a8816afa78b24cff6584b.poster.avif?t=1773070451\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/d5b64009f25a8816afa78b24cff6584b.webm?t=1773070451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/d5b64009f25a8816afa78b24cff6584b.mp4?t=1773070451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to feel every step? Jump into First-Person Mode for total immersion!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the developer &amp; how this game came to life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi I\u2019m Ramy! Light Dude is my first ever video game on Steam! This whole game was born from suffering\u2026\u00a0I was walking back from the bathroom in the dark, confident I knew the layout of my own room... until my bed frame reminded me I didn\u2019t... My toe lost 99% of its HP, but at least I unlocked a new game idea!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/9a3d8ac078512a2bdc0d193b71eb92e5.poster.avif?t=1773070451\" width=780 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/9a3d8ac078512a2bdc0d193b71eb92e5.webm?t=1773070451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/9a3d8ac078512a2bdc0d193b71eb92e5.mp4?t=1773070451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Dergham Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/32167a5bfc6124242f132dfd886bc8294a3c1c63/header.jpg?t=1773070451","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3055110/743608122/fad7daa7985bc9db3c1c6eaf35427b5a53da3a84/1773069397/dash_av1.mpd?t=1773070449","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3055110/743608122/fad7daa7985bc9db3c1c6eaf35427b5a53da3a84/1773069397/dash_h264.mpd?t=1773070449","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3055110/743608122/fad7daa7985bc9db3c1c6eaf35427b5a53da3a84/1773069397/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1773070449","id":257297